        </div>
        <div class="about-stat-item">
          <span class="num">1 person</span>
          <span class="lbl">owning your whole marketing function, end to end</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Who’s behind this</p>
        <h2>I spent a year asking business owners about their marketing. Nine in ten had the same answer.</h2>
        <p>
          Before this, I spent a year qualifying small and mid-size businesses for eBay’s Start Up–Scale Up
          programme — tens of thousands of calls, conversations with thousands of owners. The same story,
          over and over: a website nobody had touched in years, a freelancer who’d moved on, and an owner
          saying <em>“I know we should be doing more — I just don’t have the time.”</em>
        </p>
        <p>
          That finding is this service. You don’t need a five-person team or a £3,000-a-month retainer —
          you need one experienced person who takes ownership and gets the work done.
        </p>
        <p><a class="link-arrow" href="/about">The full story</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ 07 · WORK / PROOF ============
       Integrity: no fabricated case studies. Slots are labelled until real
       client results land — see TODO-HUMAN.md for what to collect. -->
  <section class="section work" id="work">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="work-head">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Results</p>
          <h2>What “handled” looks like</h2>
        </div>
