        retainer. <a href="/pricing">Full pricing breakdown and comparison</a>.
      </p>
      <div class="pricing-grid">
        {TIERS.map((t) => (
          <div class={`price-card card ${t.highlighted ? 'price-highlight' : ''}`}>
            {t.highlighted && <span class="price-flag">Most chosen</span>}
